    "2119826757054316620": {
      "author": "vikrantnyc",
      "context": "Vik Sharma (Cake Wallet) dice que miles de millones en Bitcoin salen de la autocustodia hacia ETFs porque la gente teme guardar sus propias llaves; la solución, según él, no es renunciar a las llaves sino hacer billeteras tan fáciles que el miedo no gane, y menciona el trabajo de @cakewallet.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-09T16:17:38Z",
      "created_at_chile": "2026-11-09 13:17:38 America/Santiago",
      "created_at_verified": true,
      "cta": "",
      "exclude_reason": "",
      "first_seen_at": "2026-11-09T17:22:59.627030+00:00",
      "followers_checked_at": "2026-11-09T17:22:59+00:00",
      "followers_count": 34848,
      "followers_count_verified": true,
      "followers_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids.includes.users.public_metrics.followers_count",
      "id": "2119826757054316620",
      "language": "en",
      "last_seen_at": "2026-11-09T17:22:59.627030+00:00",
      "qualification": {
        "age_seconds": 3921.627,
        "exclude_reason": "",
        "followers_checked_at": "2026-11-09T17:22:59+00:00",
        "followers_count": 34848,
        "followers_count_verified": true,
        "min_followers_exclusive": 20000,
        "qualified": true,
        "window_seconds": 7200
      },
      "qualified": true,
      "reply_blank": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119826757054316620",
      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119826757054316620&text=Agree%20the%20fear%20is%20real.%20Part%20of%20it%20is%20that%20self-custody%20often%20still%20means%20trusting%20one%20more%20company%27s%20app%20or%20device.%20Generating%20your%20own%20keys%20on%20an%20offline%20machine%20removes%20that%20layer%2C%20and%20it%27s%20less%20scary%20than%20it%20sounds.%20I%20wrote%20a%20step-by-step%20guide%20to%20building%20that%20air-gapped%20setup%20yourself%2C%20free%20on%20Kindle%20until%20Wednesday%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB0HQ5NS31N%3FdplnkId%3Dc09ef739-11f3-4c76-8c62-92ce160a3341%26nodl%3D1",
      "source_post_id": null,
      "suggested_text": "Agree the fear is real. Part of it is that self-custody often still means trusting one more company's app or device. Generating your own keys on an offline machine removes that layer, and it's less scary than it sounds. I wrote a step-by-step guide to building that air-gapped setup yourself, free on Kindle until Wednesday: https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HQ5NS31N?dplnkId=c09ef739-11f3-4c76-8c62-92ce160a3341&nodl=1",
      "timestamp_source": "x.get_posts_by_ids",
      "topic": "custodia",
      "url": "https://x.com/vikrantnyc/status/2119826757054316620"
    },
    "2119838797328179699": {
      "author": "CryptoTheBossX",
      "context": "The Boss publica una actualización macro de $BTC: el precio sigue dentro de una cuña ascendente en diario y testeó el borde superior de la 'bull market support band', con un rebote inmediato que defiende ese soporte. Dice que vigila la interacción entre las diagonales de resistencia y los pisos de soporte. Cita su análisis del 2-oct sobre divergencia bajista en RSI. Aclara que no es consejo financiero.",
